

Sephetho ngola: ((Lethathamo ← ['red'] ; ['green']) + (Lethathamo ← ['blue'])), mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: ((Lethathamo ← ['red'] ; ['green'] ; ['blue']) - 1), mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: ((Lethathamo ← ['red'] ; ['green'] ; ['blue']) - 2), mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: ((Lethathamo ← ['red'] ; ['green'] ; ['blue']) - 3), mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: ((Lethathamo ← ['red'] ; ['green'] ; ['blue']) - -2), mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: ((Lethathamo ← ['red'] ; ['green'] ; ['blue']) - 4), mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: ((Lethathamo ← ['red'] ; ['green'] ; ['blue']) - 13), mola-o-mocha.


